cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use V-LiPS-RF, please cite this software release and the associated
  paper when its final bibliographic record is available.
title: V-LiPS-RF
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
authors:
  - name: V-LiPS-RF Contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/Kilimetarlop/V-LiPS-RF
url: https://github.com/Kilimetarlop/V-LiPS-RF
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An offline SDK and command-line tool for validating RF split manifests,
  reporting fail-closed evidence states, and selecting among safe candidates
  without inspecting evaluation outcomes. It does not include RF data or train
  recognition models.
keywords:
  - radio-frequency identification
  - open-set evaluation
  - data lineage
  - split validation
  - information exposure

